      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate, highly skilled ultrasound imaging specialists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the diagnostic technicians and internists for exceptional warmth, patience, and professional competence. Clients repeatedly note that staff treat nervous or reactive pets with immense care during ultrasounds and echocardiograms, ensuring both pets and owners remain calm throughout appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Low stress handling during diagnostic procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how comfortable pets feel during imaging, often without requiring sedation. Owners appreciate being allowed into the examination room with their dogs and cats during scans. The team adapts handling to large breeds, senior pets, and anxious rescue animals, keeping them relaxed throughout the visit."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear, prompt delivery of diagnostic results"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the clinic for fast turnaround and thorough explanations of diagnostic findings. Reviewers appreciate detailed calls from internists discussing next steps, transparent pricing before scheduling, and seamless coordination sharing official ultrasound reports with primary care veterinarians."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
