    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How quickly are ultrasound and echocardiogram results delivered?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report receiving results and detailed internist callbacks promptly, typically within 24 hours of the imaging visit."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is the clinic suited for reactive or anxious animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet parents appreciate that the center schedules one patient at a time and uses low lighting and calm music to reduce stress."
